<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 105 mln rand S.African bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 105 mln rand S.African bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 105.00 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 21.18 million rands worth on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>The South African bond market was closed on Monday for the Youth Day holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
